Thought: The mass spectrometry data indicates a molecular ion peak at m/z 235.139, which suggests the molecular weight of the compound is approximately 235. This information can be used to deduce the molecular formula. To explore possible structures, I will retrieve isomers for a molecular formula that matches this molecular weight. However, I first need to determine the molecular formula that corresponds to this mass. I will use the isotopic distribution to help confirm the molecular formula.
